{"thread":{"threadID":3322,"boardID":115,"topic":"Petition zur Entbannung von Zescht","time":1453754028,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","lastPostTime":1453796180,"lastPoster":"mar1o :)","replies":16,"views":1200,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":13},"tags":[{"tagID":721,"name":"back"},{"tagID":720,"name":"come"},{"tagID":716,"name":"fun"},{"tagID":612,"name":"nicht"},{"tagID":718,"name":"RIP"},{"tagID":719,"name":"unbann"},{"tagID":394,"name":"Yolo"},{"tagID":487,"name":"Zescht"},{"tagID":717,"name":"Zest"}],"posts":[{"postID":43164,"threadID":3322,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"Petition zur Entbannung von Zescht","time":1453754028,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":13,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1453754098,"value":1},{"userID":1903,"username":"dopi","time":1453754122,"value":1},{"userID":1839,"username":"Fadey","time":1453754605,"value":1},{"userID":1950,"username":"Sabrina","time":1453754661,"value":1},{"userID":1670,"username":"Cr4ck3d","time":1453754942,"value":1},{"userID":2099,"username":"MasterShot","time":1453755000,"value":1},{"userID":1836,"username":"ApicNexie","time":1453756343,"value":1},{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1453758265,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1453759282,"value":1},{"userID":1933,"username":"Re(MiiX)","time":1453759771,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1453760969,"value":1},{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1453816621,"value":1},{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1453821061,"value":1},{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1453821718,"value":1},{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1453811062,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Zescht ist eigentlich ein freundlicher und sympathischer Kerl. Viele mögen das kaum glauben, doch man kann sich normal mit ihm unterhlaten. Er ist kein Unmensch, er ist eben er selbst. Harsch, kritisch und manchmal ein wenig impulsiv.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Zescht und ich sind nicht die besten Freunde, trotzdem war sein Bann ungerechtfertigt. Das Fass lief über, wegen einer kleinen Aussage, die irgendwo gerechtfertigt war. Jeder regt sich auf über eine Kleinigkeit, obwohl es sonst keinen interessiert hätte. Das war wohl der perfekte Moment ihn los zu werden, aber das hat er doch irgendwo nicht verdient. Hiermit möchte ich Unterschriften von den Usern der Community sammeln, das Zescht wieder entbannt wird. Wenn ihr für Zescht Entbannung seid, schreibt einfach ein dickes, grünes JA in den Thread. Optional könnt ihr auch noch einen Grund angeben, warum Zescht einfach dazu gehört.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[danker*]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[dream*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43165,"threadID":3322,"userID":1948,"username":"neoNneoN","subject":"","time":1453754177,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><strong>JA!!!!</strong><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Zescht hat einfach seinen eigenen Humor,solange keine Beschwerden von Usern reinkommen ist es meiner Meinung ungerechtfertigt da es nur 3-4 Leute gestört hat.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43166,"threadID":3322,"userID":null,"username":"KermitOS","subject":"","time":1453754212,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1948,"username":"neoNneoN","time":1453754263,"value":1},{"userID":1903,"username":"dopi","time":1453754436,"value":1},{"userID":1950,"username":"Sabrina","time":1453754626,"value":1},{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1453821107,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Aufjedenfall <u>JA</u>.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Grund: Durch Zescht bin ich damals auf dem Dream Jail Server geblieben. Dank Zescht hatte ich wirklich viel Spaß auf dem Jail Server. Zescht gehört aufjedenfall dazu. Schon immer.</p>\n<p><br></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43167,"threadID":3322,"userID":1903,"username":"dopi","subject":"","time":1453754539,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1950,"username":"Sabrina","time":1453754606,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Absoluter no-brainer für mich. Zescht war und wird für immer einer der wichtigsten Menschen in dieser Community bleiben.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Fettes JA von mir </p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43168,"threadID":3322,"userID":1950,"username":"Sabrina","subject":"","time":1453754568,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1903,"username":"dopi","time":1453754767,"value":1},{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1453826301,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>#ProtestforZescht!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Grund: Er und Kermit sind einfach ein Dreamteam  <span class=\"missing-media\">[&lt;3]</span> <br>Sein Bann war unbegründet und total doof zumal hier mache nur zum Trollen sind und er wie oben geschreiben, er selbst ist.  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span>  <br></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43169,"threadID":3322,"userID":1839,"username":"Fadey","subject":"","time":1453754634,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1903,"username":"dopi","time":1453754768,"value":1},{"userID":1950,"username":"Sabrina","time":1453755703,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1453759299,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Yes, cuz hes cute <span class=\"missing-media\">[&lt;3]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43170,"threadID":3322,"userID":1670,"username":"Cr4ck3d","subject":"","time":1453754896,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID